  //   over ≥ 10 versions, non-systematic disagreements, and n ≥ 50 (D-045 amendment).
  //   Until then the edge below is the only one it gets.
  Judge [color: orange, icon: award, label: "arize-phoenix-evals — P2.6a · the ONLY judged metric\nCerebras, NEVER the Claude quota (D-016)\ncriterion 1 DUPLICATES the mechanical check → its error rate (D-041)\nhad no build row at all until DEF-009"]
}

