// The ScorePy edge below was missing in draft 2, and its absence was a CONTENT
// error before it was ever a layout one: mine.py has to read something, and
// what it reads is the scored results. Adding it also moved this section from
// adrift at the top of the canvas to beside the gate it feeds — the fix for the
